          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.259,
            0.348,
            0.476,
            0.365
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Cwmwamam"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.373,
            0.798,
            0.391
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The Earth rotates on its own axis in about 24 hours."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.393,
            0.883,
            0.449
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The Earth’s rotation from West to East causes day and night as well as the apparent motion of the Sun, the Moon, and the stars."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.451,
            0.882,
            0.489
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The Earth revolves around the Sun and takes nearly 1 year to complete a revolution."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.268,
            0.491,
            0.882,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The Earth’s axis of rotation is not upright with respect to the orbit, but is tilted."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.268,
            0.53,
            0.882,
            0.568
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Seasons occur because of the tilt of the Earth’s axis of rotation and its spherical shape."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.268,
            0.569,
            0.883,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A solar eclipse occurs when the Moon is in the path of the Sun as seen from the Earth, and sunlight is blocked from reaching the Earth."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.268,
            0.627,
            0.883,
            0.683
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A lunar eclipse occurs when the Earth comes in between the Sun and the Moon, blocking sunlight from reaching the Moon."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.273,
            0.695,
            0.655,
            0.718
          ],
          "content": [
